{"id":"5dedce8a568a544a","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Set Coded Function Graph","display":"df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph — ZFC Set10 Set Coded Function Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph — ZFC Set10 Set Coded Function Graph","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph — ZFC Set10 Set Coded Function Graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,A,B\\in V\">\\(G,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10SetCodedFunctionGraph}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10SetCodedFunctionGraph}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}set\\text{-}coded\\text{-}function\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10SetCodedFunctionGraph}_S(G,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(G,A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}set\\text{-}coded\\text{-}function\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10SetCodedFunctionGraph}_S(G,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(G,A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical function predicate already states that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq A\\times B\">\\(G\\subseteq A\\times B\\)</span> and assigns exactly one value in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> to each element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10SetCodedFunctionGraph}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}set\\text{-}coded\\text{-}function\\text{-}graph}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10SetCodedFunctionGraph}_S(G,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(G,A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"G\\subseteq A\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":967,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph.md|58-df-zfc-set10-set-coded-function-graph]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}